    "Name": "Onager 2",
    "Details": "Designed as a cost effective Assault grade battlemech, the Onager OGR-2 was created by the Jade Falcons to replace captured Inner Sphere mechs used by Garrison troops. A 270-rated Fusion Core and an Endo Steel chassis allow the mech to carry a mammoth HAG/30. Supporting this are a pair of Large Pulse Lasers and a pair of SRM-6’s with 2 Micro Pulse Lasers and a Small Pulse Laser deterring Infantry.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Battle Fists</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.22</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limit: Left Upper</color>",
    "Icon": "Onager"
  },
